# AEGIS OpenTelemetry

Follow `Docs/specs/Engineering/OPENTELEMETRY_TELEMETRY.md`.

- Use `TelemetryPort`; do not hard-require a remote collector.
- Default to console/file exporter for offline demos.
- Allow-list span attributes (ids, hashes, flags); deny PII, secrets, raw narratives, full prompts.
- Correlate `trace_id` with audit `event_id` / `request_id`.
- Telemetry failures must not bypass safety fail-closed controls.
